{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garenburg Woods is a happy RPG game made in RPG Maker 2000. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Garenburg Woods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egly is going on a trip with his friends, Elfy, Carib, Yhien, and Malik. The friends are heading over to the Garenburg Cliffs, a wonderful place that is said to have a beautiful sight. Everybody is sure to have a great time... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story filled with lore and secrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 different bosses to fight </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RISK Mode: limited saves, harder boss fights, more secrets, and risky items only that will decrease stats or improve your strength </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy Mode: extremely overpowered and for those who want to play purely for plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous party members with unique abilities to populate your team </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of secrets to find and areas to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on trail  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dolls and puppets </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Average Playthrough Length</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are estimates and can vary for your actual playthrough and if you know what you're doing. Your time could differ from this.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring things and just trying to get by as quickly as possible - 30 minutes to 2 hours </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring and finding around half of the content - 1-3 hours </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting the true ending and main content events - 2-6 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be happy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e1b582662ea46ef2f0493d066006f5bf04464cb7.jpg","localized_name":"Green","name":"Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/e1b582662ea46ef2f0493d066006f5bf04464cb7.jpg"},{"icon":"efb0f1f5848545dbdc29ec7089d6e53d8b72b9b6.jpg","localized_name":"Blue","name":"Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/efb0f1f5848545dbdc29ec7089d6e53d8b72b9b6.jpg"},{"icon":"2b468d03dfd3e2cb7a72b0f5a1a10ef9641134aa.jpg","localized_name":"Black","name":"Black","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/2b468d03dfd3e2cb7a72b0f5a1a10ef9641134aa.jpg"},{"icon":"1c3a13f260600a7b6ee98ca3d7de431bd9756f0b.jpg","localized_name":"Gray","name":"Gray","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/1c3a13f260600a7b6ee98ca3d7de431bd9756f0b.jpg"},{"icon":"c68fcd37e543c222aa3fbac8034770daaf610d57.jpg","localized_name":"Tear Drops","name":"Tear Drops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/c68fcd37e543c222aa3fbac8034770daaf610d57.jpg"},{"icon":"027e790d3bcc0483e949296749896022a7e9377b.jpg","localized_name":"Orange","name":"Orange","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/027e790d3bcc0483e949296749896022a7e9377b.jpg"},{"icon":"1bfbf333583ce559fda30e3baceaf86a4cd4cba2.jpg","localized_name":"RUSSELL LIVES","name":"RUSSELL LIVES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/750610/1bfbf333583ce559fda30e3baceaf86a4cd4cba2.jpg"},{"icon":"5243a864a542cd02afcc98ac8ffc1397ec21bfd1.jpg","localized_name":"Red","name":"Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/7